Package: ROW
Type: Package
Title: Regularised Outcome-Weighted Estimation of the Average Treatment Effect
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dimitris", "Karletsos", email = "dimitris.karletsos@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates the average treatment effect (ATE) for comparisons of two or
    more treatments in observational data with limited covariate overlap. The ROW
    estimator averages per-arm outcome models over all patients and corrects them with
    residuals weighted by regularised inverse probability weights 1/(e_A(X) + 1/lambda).
    The tuning parameter lambda is chosen by an outcome-blind balance rule, and
    standard errors come from an M-estimation sandwich that accounts for estimation of
    the generalised propensity score and the outcome models.
